{"name": "STARIO: Haven Tower", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"377\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/390790bec1c41ef5e7de1db8ebce0be5.avif?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/b62f1a0fa3e79f5246b582652b2061c0.webp?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/81acd84514c8c1207bf892c47826bb53.poster.avif?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/81acd84514c8c1207bf892c47826bb53.webm?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/81acd84514c8c1207bf892c47826bb53.mp4?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse six atmospheric layers: Sand, Mist, Rain, Frost, Clear Skies, and the Stars. Defying gravity as you climb upward, until the tower pierces the heavens and glory reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/3b65e5686363df65a0fac9d81c5cbfee.webp?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1ca0abe205e911a73d99db20f8e5cb48.poster.avif?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1ca0abe205e911a73d99db20f8e5cb48.webm?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1ca0abe205e911a73d99db20f8e5cb48.mp4?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tower layer stores its own supplies. With manpower, pipelines, hot-air balloons, even Stronghands hurling cargo skyward...Weave together a seamless vertical network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/88c91374afc2ef4f829810a0b8997ec4.webp?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/e87608681c7228f8fbbe99523e3e5922.poster.avif?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/e87608681c7228f8fbbe99523e3e5922.webm?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/e87608681c7228f8fbbe99523e3e5922.mp4?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinforce the tower with braces to expand outward. Suspended sky gardens, lattice-like aerial platforms, defy gravity for boundless creations in your celestial city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/2745735f1c2f6c437df9776ea8c9a3ea.webp?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/5394c208f59caa4afeb0169b5a2aceba.poster.avif?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/5394c208f59caa4afeb0169b5a2aceba.webm?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/5394c208f59caa4afeb0169b5a2aceba.mp4?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge Ritual Platforms, where the faith of your Towertizens gathers into a force that can summon wind and rain. Fulfill their wishes, and they will gift you their most precious gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"47\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/f19fa337e0b1122bf0f45095ae89f7f8.webp?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/696ceb030df8925e435470404d8b8dda.poster.avif?t=1782442692\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/696ceb030df8925e435470404d8b8dda.webm?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/696ceb030df8925e435470404d8b8dda.mp4?t=1782442692\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the tower ascends, Towertizens will endure trials of faith and disaster. Light Miracle Towers as beacons of hope that bolster morale, efficiency, and pacify the calamities.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A vertical kingdom in the sky! Plan your ascent from the harsh Sand Zone, rising layer by layer as you and your Towertizens stand together against looming disasters. Build trade ports and vertical supply networks. Perform Rituals to shape miracles, and witness the prosperity of this rising nation.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/04b28820612a91b8f044d50195f9719f6a2ca10b/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1782442692", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["City Builder", "Resource Management", "Strategy", "Post-apocalyptic", "Simulation", "Building"], "developers": "Stargate Games", "publishers": "Stargate Games", "release_date": "Sep 25, 2025", "price": "$13.99", "appid": "3209750", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "24 March 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/YVSmuDExU44", "first_seen": 1742774400.0, "review_rank": 1759}